Contract:
    - Population: every tracked path matching ``.ufo/waves/round-*/count-*.py``
      (one directory level below ``.ufo/waves/``, extension ``.py``) or
      ``tools/round<N>-*.py`` (a round-scoped counter kept in ``tools/``).
